"help.buffer" = "Pause keeps preparing the buffer. Behind the playhead: elapsed playback in the system colour (usually blue). Ahead: bright purple is recognition in progress, pale purple is recognised text; blue is translation or review; teal is ready text; orange is speech generation; light grey is ready audio. ChatGPT percentages cover the whole account.";
"help.export" = "More → Save voice and subtitles: choose a folder, prepare the entire lecture and save M4A with Russian SRT and available German SRT. Playback takes priority; pause does not stop preparation. Cached parts are reused. Cancel restores normal buffering and keeps the cache. Original audio and volume settings are not included in the Kseniya track.";
"help.controls" = "Choose the controls layout under View or Settings. The arrow hides it; the bottom edge reveals it. In fullscreen, all buttons share the bottom panel; only the system menu appears at the top. Video behind the title bar separately enables top-edge overlap in windowed mode. Space plays or pauses; Esc exits fullscreen.";
"help.languages" = "Choose the interface language on first launch or in Settings. This does not change a lecture’s subtitles or voice. Currently German is translated into Russian and read by Kseniya.";
